  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{写生|しゃせい}する (to sketch from life)\n・{写生|しゃせい}{大会|たいかい} (sketching contest)\n・{写生|しゃせい}{帳|ちょう} (sketchbook)\n・{風景|ふうけい}{写生|しゃせい} (landscape sketching)\n・{人物|じんぶつ}{写生|しゃせい} (figure drawing)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・スケッチ - sketch (loanword, similar meaning)\n・デッサン - drawing (from French, often basic drawing practice)\n・{描|か}く - to draw/paint (general)\n\nCULTURAL NOTE:\n{写生|しゃせい}{大会|たいかい} (sketching contests) are common school activities in Japan, where students go outdoors to draw from nature.\n\n[Register: Neutral]",
